<title>USA: Atmos Energy closes United Cities merger.</title>
<headline>Atmos Energy closes United Cities merger.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atmos Energy Corp on Tuesday said it closed its merger agreement with United Cities Gas of Brentwood, Tenn.</p>
<p>In a statement, Atmos said the merger will make it the 12th largest natural gas distribution company in the U.S. based on the number of customers served.</p>
<p>The company said United Cities would continue to operate under its own name as a division of Atmos.</p>
<p>Atmos provides natural gas service to bout 1 million customers in 13 states.</p>
</text>
